      "content": "everyone keeps telling me it gets better or to find support but i don't see it. i look at the world and it's just greed and people looking out for themselves. i tried to be different and looked out for what was right and it literally destroyed me. it's like i'm fighting a war that's already over. i'm just exhausted from trying to exist in a place that clearly doesn't want me here. does it ever actually end, or is this just what life is now? constant fighting just to stay afloat in a sinking ship?",
